		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Scythe-like limbs jut from an ogre-sized, bulbous spider thorax. Covered with a plethora of black spider eyes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 scythe +6 (1d10) and 1 eye ray, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Eye Ray</strong>. Ray can target one creature or an object up to 1,000 pounds (up to four on same target). 1. Fire. DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage. 2. Cold. DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage. 3. Lightning. DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage. 4. Petrification. CON 15+ or petrified.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to cold.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
